    "Check the grounds for the attached passage. Distinguish inspected primary sources, analysis Notes and your inferences. Cite only material you have read with its location; leave claims unverified where the required source is unavailable. Discuss in Chat without changing Notes." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Check the grounds for the attached passage. Distinguish inspected primary sources, analysis Notes and your inferences. Cite only material you have read with its location; leave claims unverified where the required source is unavailable. Discuss in Chat without changing Notes."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "请核对所附选段的依据。区分实际查验的原始文献、分析笔记和你的推断。只引用读到的材料并注明位置；所需原文无法取得时，明确保留未核实状态。先在聊天中讨论，不修改笔记。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
