    "Field definitions and About visibility are portable Triptych settings. They do not edit existing Note metadata or Markdown source." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Field definitions and About visibility are portable Triptych settings. They do not edit existing Note metadata or Markdown source."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "字段定义与“关于”可见性属于便携脉络设置，不会编辑现有笔记元数据或 Markdown 源文本。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Field keys and types are permanent. Archiving preserves stored values." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Field keys and types are permanent. Archiving preserves stored values."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "字段键和类型不可更改。归档会保留已有值。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fields added here become optional Metadata fields for every Note in this role. A field key and value type are permanent. Labels, descriptions, and order can change; archiving is reversible and preserves every stored value." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此处添加的字段会成为该角色下每篇笔记的可选元数据字段。字段键和值类型不可更改。标签、说明和顺序可以修改；归档可撤销，并会保留所有已存储的值。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
