            "value" : "主题分隔线"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These commands register the same local stdio server at user scope. Scholium copies the command only; it does not edit either host’s settings or claim setup succeeded." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这些命令会在用户范围内注册同一个本地 stdio 服务器。Scholium 只复制命令；不会编辑任一宿主的设置，也不会声称设置成功。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These current-schema settings need review before managed creation can resume." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这些当前架构版本的设置需要检查，之后才能恢复托管创建。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These durations apply only to derived issue reminders. Dismissing a reminder does not change any Note or researcher-authored judgment." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这些时长只适用于派生问题提醒。关闭提醒不会更改任何笔记或研究者撰写的判断。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These folders are independent. Keeping them under one parent can make the workspace easier to move and back up." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "These folders are independent. Keeping them under one parent can make the workspace easier to move and back up."
